    {
      "text": "not make unto thee any graven image, Ex. 20:4 (Lev. 26:1; Mosiah 12:36; 13:12). onyx stones, and grave on them the names, Ex. 28:9 (39:6). Confounded be all they that serve graven images, Ps. 97:7. I have graven thee upon the palms of my hands, Isa. 49:16. every founder is confounded by the graven image, Jer. 10:14. graven upon the table of their heart, Jer. 17:1. Thy graven images also will I cut off, Micah 5:13 (3 Ne. 21:17).",
